[Unit]
Description=cc-reconcile: pull the shared skills, make the board match the box, sweep what is dead, wake a seat with startable work, post the daily line
[Service]
Type=oneshot
# Findings go through cc-broker, so one digest per window reaches the session instead of a wake each.
Environment=CC_RECONCILE_INJECT=%h/bin/cc-broker CC_BROKER_SOURCE=reconcile
# THE SHARED SKILLS RIDE THIS TURN TOO, and go FIRST: cc-skills fast-forwards each skill in the tree's config/skills.list
# into ~/.claude/skills (and so into every member workspace, ro — cc-sandbox skills_bind). Its own timeout per fetch,
# and `-` because a pull that failed keeps the last good copy and says so once itself; it must not stop the reconcile.
ExecStart=-%h/bin/cc-skills sync
# THE TEMP REAP RIDES IT TOO, and goes before the reconcile, so a reconcile that fails cannot skip it when /tmp is full:
# cc-tmp-reap removes what the box's own tools left in /tmp and ~/.cc/tmp — named families only, over 24 h old, held by
# no process, a dead session's scratch or a dead landing's run root. /tmp is a tmpfs with a per-user quota and the pile
# reached it mid-landing twice. `-` because a reap that failed is not a failed reconcile; `timeout` because a oneshot
# has no start timeout, and what a cut-short reap left the next tick takes.
ExecStart=-/usr/bin/timeout 300 %h/bin/cc-tmp-reap --apply
ExecStart=%h/bin/cc-reconcile --apply --notify
# THE BUNDLE TICK RIDES THIS TURN AND HAS NO UNIT OF ITS OWN: cc-bundle starts ONE worker for the queued rows that
# share a file (its own docstring has the whole of it) and holds while the project is parked, the landing queue is
# full, the tier or a usage limit says wait, or two bundles are already live — so its cadence is "within 20 min of
# the queue freeing", which is this timer's. `-` because a dispatch refused is a line in
# ~/.cc/state/bundle/<repo>.jsonl, never this unit red.
ExecStart=-%h/bin/cc-bundle --tick
# exit 1 means "found something only a person can settle" — that is the tool working, not the unit failing.
SuccessExitStatus=1
